  dialogueLines:
  - 'Welcome to the Han Dynasty! Find the librarian, Click OK on the controller and
    he will tell you what you need to know. '
  - Find the Bathouse and steal a minister's cloth
  - If you see a drunk guy on the way, you can steal from him
  - Head to the palace gate and if you have completed all your requirements, you
    will get to meet the emperor
